WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.307
You buy a cup of tea,

2
00:00:01.307 --> 00:00:02.142
scan a code,

3
00:00:02.142 --> 00:00:02.793
type your PIN,

4
00:00:02.793 --> 00:00:04.627
and the money moves before the tea

5
00:00:04.627 --> 00:00:05.625
cools.

6
00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:07.052
What just happened?

7
00:00:07.452 --> 00:00:10.285
Your app sends the request to NPCI,

8
00:00:10.285 --> 00:00:12.224
the body that runs UPI.

9
00:00:12.224 --> 00:00:14.511
NPCI routes it to your bank,

10
00:00:14.511 --> 00:00:16.067
which checks your PIN and takes the

11
00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:17.111
money.

12
00:00:17.111 --> 00:00:18.795
Then it tells the seller's bank to

13
00:00:18.795 --> 00:00:19.594
pay.

14
00:00:19.994 --> 00:00:22.061
Three ideas make it work.

15
00:00:22.061 --> 00:00:24.661
A simple ID instead of account numbers.

16
00:00:24.661 --> 00:00:26.391
Any app talks to any bank.

17
00:00:26.391 --> 00:00:27.633
And it runs round the clock,

18
00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:28.932
in real time.

19
00:00:29.332 --> 00:00:31.817
UPI launched in twenty sixteen.

20
00:00:31.817 --> 00:00:33.361
By twenty twenty-four,

21
00:00:33.361 --> 00:00:35.311
Indians were making well over a hundred

22
00:00:35.311 --> 00:00:37.295
billion UPI payments a year.

23
00:00:37.694 --> 00:00:39.853
NPCI was set up under the RBI's

24
00:00:39.853 --> 00:00:41.514
guidance by banks.

25
00:00:41.514 --> 00:00:43.174
It doesn't hold your money;

26
00:00:43.174 --> 00:00:44.555
banks do.

27
00:00:44.555 --> 00:00:46.413
It is the road the money travels

28
00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:47.236
on.

29
00:00:47.636 --> 00:00:50.167
UPI is now linked with payment systems

30
00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:52.106
in several other countries,

31
00:00:52.106 --> 00:00:53.743
so it is part of India's foreign

32
00:00:53.743 --> 00:00:54.995
policy too.

33
00:00:55.395 --> 00:00:56.382
For GS Three:

34
00:00:56.382 --> 00:00:59.203
UPI is public digital infrastructure.

35
00:00:59.203 --> 00:01:01.688
Interoperable, real-time and cheap,

36
00:01:01.688 --> 00:01:04.519
it pulled millions into digital payments.

